; A residual too small to write at the precision the entry uses for that
; commodity counts as zero: 1.00 EUR at 1.0851 is $1.0851, and against a cash
; leg written to the cent that leaves $0.0049, inside the half a cent two
; decimal places allow. The commodity directive below has no say in it under
; hledger's default balancing: it is the $-1.09 leg's own two places that set
; the boundary, and deleting the directive changes nothing.
commodity $1000.00

2024-01-01 Card payment abroad
    Expenses:Travel    1.00 EUR @ $1.0851
    Liabilities:Card   $-1.09
